00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:03.540
Marquez Brownlee ordered a cyber cab after Tesla opened invite-only orders, not a Tesla

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:08.060
app reports, with deliveries expected weeks before the deadline for his headshaving bet.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:13.200
That order sits on a subscription lock that goes well beyond the monthly fee Tesla posted

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.340
when invites went out.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:23.380
Buyers pay $29,990 upfront, yet must maintain a $299 monthly autonomy subscription that the

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:30.120
vehicle physically requires to operate, adding $3,588 annually after the first free month.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.280
The first month of the subscription is included at no charge, but the agreement makes clear

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:39.740
that the car cannot function without an active plan covering self-driving, connectivity,

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.580
and certain maintenance items.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:47.340
Tesla can adjust that price after notice, which converts a one-time hardware sale into an

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.860
ongoing service relationship.

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:54.540
Owners may drive only inside geo-fenced areas already approved for Tesla's Robotaxi

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:58.840
service and cannot add the car to ride-hailing fleets without company permission.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:03.640
Regulators are still evaluating whether the steering wheel-free design meets federal

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:09.220
motor vehicle safety standards, so the subscription itself cannot guarantee nationwide usability

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.540
until approvals arrive.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:15.800
Tesla has stated that availability will expand across the United States as those approvals

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:16.400
are secured.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:22.100
A Shoke Ellis Swamy noted that privately-owned cybercabs will operate without human supervision

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:26.840
inside the same geographic zones used by the company's commercial Robotaxi fleet.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:32.800
The vehicle features a gold-colored exterior, two passenger seats, and butterfly-style doors.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:38.280
For Tesla, the model reduces capital intensity by shifting some operating costs to owners

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:41.180
while preserving control over software and maintenance.

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:47.020
It also creates a direct link between vehicle utilization and subscription revenue that scales

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:50.560
with regulatory expansion rather than with additional factory output.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:56.740
The approach mirrors earlier connectivity and full self-driving or FSD subscriptions, but

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.560
now applies to the entire vehicle.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:05.040
Elon Musk has already flagged that the current $299 monthly fee is too high and should

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:12.420
line closer to the roughly $115 cost of FSD plus connectivity on other models. A non-refundable

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:17.980
$1,000 deposit is required to place an order, with first customer deliveries targeted for

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:24.700
December of 2026. Giga-Texas' cellplant push was the first of three threads that ran through

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:30.694
the past seven days. Tesla expanded battery output there in a move that positions Giga-Texas

00:08:30.694 --> 00:08:35.274
to become North America's largest cell plant, and that standing has not changed.

00:08:35.874 --> 00:08:40.214
Finland approved Tesla's assisted driving system ahead of the December European Union

00:08:40.214 --> 00:08:43.194
